# The user guide is a real static page at /guide/. Cloudflare Pages matches
# static assets before these rules, so /guide/index.html and its images resolve
# on their own. This line only covers the no-trailing-slash form, so a shared
# link like karmyogi.hjlabs.in/guide can never fall through to the SPA shell.
/guide    /guide/index.html    200

# SPA fallback — every other unmatched path renders the app.
/*    /index.html   200
